                                    <br />
                                    <a href="https://www.dpsa.gov.za/dpsa2g/documents/ep/2020/Approved%20New%20Z83%20form%20Gazetted%206%20Nov%202020.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary mt-2">
                                        <i class="fas fa-download me-1"></i>Download Z83 Form
